WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.602 --> 00:00:05.405
1. In Manage hosting, open PHP version.

2
00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:12.402
2. Choose the domain, then the version you need.

3
00:00:12.402 --> 00:00:17.258
3. Click Switch version.

4
00:00:17.258 --> 00:00:21.310
4. Open your website and check that it still works.
